val=0,When you're on top of the world it's all downhill from there.
val=1,What if you've already peaked?
val=2,Some people are always the worst dressed in the room.
val=3,To avoid criticism do nothing.
val=4,All things have an end.
val=5,Abandon all hope.
val=6,Keep your expectations reasonable.
val=7,Today is the youngest you will ever be.
val=8,The first step towards failure is trying.
val=9,Just because you're unique doesn't mean you are useful.
val=10,What doesn't break you today will try again tomorrow.
val=11,Change isn't always good.
val=12,If at first you don't succeed, give up.
val=13,There is always a 'u' in failure.
val=14,Life is like a circle; pointless.
val=15,You look like a dungeoneering floor, because everyone will abandon you.
val=16,Nothing interesting happens.
default=When you're on top of the world it's all downhill from there.

