// 8304
[pop2_re3_answerlist]
inputtype=int
outputtype=string
val=0,A cog. It looks a little worn, but should still work.
val=1,A bottle of rum. It's not the best stuff, but they won't notice.
val=2,A sturdy looking rope, not frayed at all.
val=3,A hammer. It's hit quite a few nails on the head.
val=4,A marlinspike. Great for untangling knots.
val=5,A fine oak plank.
val=6,A lantern. Will probably need a new candle soon, but will do for now.
val=7,A well crafted cutlass. I'm surprised someone has misplaced this.
val=8,A hefty cannonball. Could do some serious damage to ships, or toes if you drop it.
val=9,A simple saw, still sharp though.
val=10,A bolt of cloth, similar to sail material.
val=11,A length of chain. Great for jobs that rope can't handle.
val=12,A good rod. It's not super or anything.
default=null

// 8305
[pop2_re3_cluelist1]
inputtype=int
outputtype=string
val=0,Some of our loading equipment has had a part stolen, we need to find a spare part for the turning mechanism.
val=1,The sailors love their drink. Surula needs restocking of the usual stuff.
val=2,The lines on the ship are always getting damaged. Get some fresh lines so they can secure the cargo.
val=3,One of the repairmen dropped a tool into the sea while working. All I know is that he was attempting to nail up a sign.
val=4,The sailors have got themselves in a pickle - they've knotted all the rope into a big mess. Find them a tool to help them out.
val=5,Someone in the dry dock underestimated how much wood they would need for a job. I think we have some extra in here.
val=6,Some of the crews have reported that they need more light on deck during night watch.
val=7,Some sailors feel they need to be better armed. We have some spare weapons in here.
val=8,Ammo for the ship weapons is running low. I'm sure I saw some being sent up here.
val=9,The dry dock workers need some extra tools to correct the length of some misordered planks.
val=10,We need to patch a hole in a sail. Find something suitable.
val=11,We've received a new anchor, but nothing to attach it to the ship. The inventory for the warehouse said it was sent here.
val=12,Food supplies on the voyages can be extended by letting the sailors catch their own meals.
default=null

