val=elfcity_maw_damage_qbd,Increases damage dealt to the Queen Black Dragon by 10%.
val=elfcity_maw_damage_qbd_unused,Increases damage dealt to the Queen Black Dragon by 10%.
val=elfcity_maw_damage_rushofblood,Increases damage dealt to creatures within the Rush of Blood minigame by 10%.
val=elfcity_maw_damage_rushofblood_unused,Increases damage dealt to creatures within the Rush of Blood minigame by 10%.
val=elfcity_maw_damage_volcanic,Increases damage dealt to creatures within the Tzhaar Fight Kiln by 10%.
val=elfcity_maw_damage_volcanic_unused,Increases damage dealt to creatures within the Tzhaar Fight Kiln by 10%.
val=elfcity_maw_increase_artisan,When earning over 0.25% respect, earn an additional 0.25% respect in the Artisans' Workshop.
val=elfcity_maw_increase_artisan_unused,When earning over 0.25% respect, earn an additional 0.25% respect in the Artisans' Workshop.
val=elfcity_maw_increase_barb,Doubles the role points gained within Barbarian Assault.
val=elfcity_maw_increase_barb_unused,Doubles the role points gained within Barbarian Assault.
val=elfcity_maw_increase_castlewars,Doubles the amount of tickets earned, when eligible for a golden ticket.
val=elfcity_maw_increase_castlewars_unused,Doubles the amount of tickets earned, when eligible for a golden ticket.
val=elfcity_maw_increase_champscroll,Increases the drop rate for Champion's scrolls by 20%.
val=elfcity_maw_increase_champscroll_unused,Increases the drop rate for Champion's scrolls by 20%.
val=elfcity_maw_increase_chimp,Doubles the length of time a chimp-ice is frozen for after casting ice spells on it.
val=elfcity_maw_increase_chimp_unused,Doubles the length of time a chimp-ice is frozen for after casting ice spells on it.
val=elfcity_maw_increase_chompy,Doubles the amount of kills a chompy bird counts for.
val=elfcity_maw_increase_chompy_unused,Doubles the amount of kills a chompy bird counts for.
val=elfcity_maw_increase_darkbeast,Guarantees a dark beast assignment from Morvran.
val=elfcity_maw_increase_darkbeast_unused,Guarantees a dark beast assignment from Morvran.
val=elfcity_maw_increase_livid,Doubles produce points gained from all actions on Livid Farm.
val=elfcity_maw_increase_livid_unused,Doubles produce points gained from all actions on Livid Farm.
val=elfcity_maw_increase_morvranchallenge,If you die while fighting the boss monsters on Morvran's challenge you will be resurrected.
val=elfcity_maw_increase_morvranchallenge_unused,If you die while fighting the boss monsters on Morvran's challenge you will be resurrected.
val=elfcity_maw_increase_ports,Activate to receive a random event reward item for Player-Owned Ports.
val=elfcity_maw_increase_ports_unused,Activate to receive a random event reward item for Player-Owned Ports.
val=elfcity_maw_increase_tacklebox,Doubles the amount of medals gained from Fish Flingers.
val=elfcity_maw_increase_tacklebox_unused,Doubles the amount of medals gained from Fish Flingers.
val=elfcity_maw_increase_whiteknight,Doubles the amount of kills a Black Knight counts for.
val=elfcity_maw_increase_whiteknight_unused,Doubles the amount of kills a Black Knight counts for.
val=elfcity_maw_damage_blank,You can exchange the unfocused damage enhancer for a damage enhancer of your choice.
val=elfcity_maw_increase_blank,You can exchange the unfocused reward increaser for a reward enhancer of your choice.
val=elfcity_maw_increase_invention_task,Automatically grants a new Invention tech tree task when completing one.
val=elfcity_maw_increase_agile_outfit,Grants an additional lap of progress towards the agile outfit per completed lap.
val=elfcity_maw_increase_menaphos_quest,Grants +100% base reputation, achievement progress and the chance to receive jewels when completing a Menaphos city quest.
val=elfcity_maw_increase_construction_contract,Grants +100% Construction Credits when completing a construction contract.
val=elfcity_maw_increase_base_camp,Grants +20% drop chance increase for special items required to upgrade buildings in Anachronia's base camp.
default=

