val=4,Sounds like a cool idea, put it on RuneLabs!
val=5,Please report any bots you see so our team can take a look.
val=6,Don't forget to follow @RuneScape on Twitter.
val=7,Great to hear your feedback. I'll be sure to pass it on to the right people!
val=8,You can't apply to be a P-Mod - if chosen we contact you via game inbox.
val=9,We select players who are friendly, helpful and who follow the rules for P-Mod.
