val=13,The people here are simple good-hearted folk.
val=12,Farmers, fishermen, miners.
val=11,These lands are rich and teem with life.
val=10,Through gleaming rivers and ageless woods,
val=9,magic sleeps beneath the earth.
val=8,My people have no fear of the dark-
val=7,But the darkness may find them yet.
val=6,I know what lurks within it.
val=5,They poison the very land with their lust for blood.
val=4,These monsters are the greatest danger my people have ever known.
val=3,Stand with me against these ancient, treacherous creatures.
