// 14864
[tns_room2_box12_text]
inputtype=int
outputtype=string
val=0,<col=ff0000>Primrose:</col> I returned to the house, flinging the cloak under my bed. My legs trembled with the night's effort.
val=1,<col=ff0000>Primrose:</col> My friends asked where I had been, as if they didn't know. Thok, Hannibus, Baba, Gilly: they all talked as if nothing had happened.
val=2,<col=ff0000>Primrose:</col> Then mum walked in, her silhouette filling and darkening the room. My friends retreated to their books, as if mum could see them.
val=3,<col=ff0000>Primrose:</col> Mum leaned over me, kissed my cheek and whispered 'Happy Birthday, Little Primrose' before turning to leave.
val=4,<col=ff0000>Primrose:</col> I reached below my bed for my cloak, and searched in the pockets for the diary. I flicked to my birthday, and there it was.
default=null

// 14865
