// 14866
[tns_room2_box13_text]
inputtype=int
outputtype=string
val=0,<col=ff0000>Primrose:</col> There was one story I never read. It was about a demon: a hateful thing.
val=1,<col=ff0000>Primrose:</col> This demon would thrive on the misery of others. But not by consuming that evil, or anything like that.
val=2,<col=ff0000>Primrose:</col> She was miserable herself. And she would bring others into her own misery, so that she could share it. She would bask in that shared misery.
val=3,<col=ff0000>Primrose:</col> But to know her was to defeat her. To say her name was to stab her through the heart.
val=4,<col=ff0000>Primrose:</col> Her name was Metum. I made the mistake of reading the book once, bringing her to life. But I said her name aloud, and she was gone.
default=null

// 14867
[tns_room2_box13_text_npc]
inputtype=int
outputtype=string
val=0,<p=0>There was one story I never read. It was about a demon: a hateful thing.
val=1,<p=0>This demon would thrive on the misery of others. But not by consuming that evil, or anything like that.
val=2,<p=0>She was miserable herself. And she would bring others into her own misery, so that she could share it. She would bask in that shared misery.
val=3,<p=0>But to know her was to defeat her. To say her name was to stab her through the heart.
val=4,<p=0>Her name was Metum. I made the mistake of reading the book once, bringing her to life. But I said her name aloud, and she was gone.
default=null

// 14868
