// 14880
[tns_room2_box20_text]
inputtype=int
outputtype=string
val=0,<col=ff0000> Primrose:</col> On the day before my birthday, there was only one entry.
val=1,<col=ff0000> Primrose:</col> But on the day of my birthday, there were multiple. I read each entry on my birthday: there were several, in tiny handwriting.
val=2,<col=ff0000> Primrose:</col> 'She looks so much healthier'. 'Every time I travel back, I forget how much healthier she looks'. 'How can I give up seeing her this well?' 
val=3,<col=ff0000> Primrose:</col> Travelling back? What have you done, mum? 
default=null

// 14881
